1[.] Read A Strong[ Start] in Language.
This Ruth Beechick title for[ beginning] grades is recommended widely — from[ The] Well-Tr[ained] Mind[ to] Sonlight. Typically packaged as part of[ The] Three Rs, A[ Strong] Start in Language helps you become the editor from the beginning — from the time[ your] child traces his first letters, to copywork, and through dictation. Read our[ full] review (scroll down).
2[.] Read You Can[ Teach Your Child] Successfully.
